<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>The U-Curve Brain</title><link>https://maxmrry.github.io/curious-rabbit-hole-bot/</link><description>A macro-autonomous cognitive filter. Optimizing for agency, perspective, and resilience.</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><image><url>https://raw.githubusercontent.com/maxmrry/curious-rabbit-hole-bot/main/bot-logo.png</url><title>U-Curve Brain</title><link>https://maxmrry.github.io/curious-rabbit-hole-bot/feed.xml</link></image><lastBuildDate>Tue, 19 May 2026 08:36:44 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>(Video) New state of matter explains Earth's core properties</title><link>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qQmfXVE6W-I</link><description>&lt;b&gt;Source:&lt;/b&gt; PBS Space Time&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src='https://i.ytimg.com/vi/qQmfXVE6W-I/hqdefault.jpg' alt='thumbnail' style='max-width:100%; border-radius:8px;'/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This video investigates the perplexing properties of Earth's core, which challenge conventional scientific understanding. It proposes that a newly identified state of matter could provide a comprehensive explanation for the core's unusual characteristics and behavior. The video explores geophysical theories.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;small&gt;&lt;b&gt;How did this land?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href='https://redirect-service-73lh.onrender.com/signal?item=qQmfXVE6W-I&amp;signal=3&amp;source=PBS%20Space%20Time&amp;type=youtube&amp;context=amazingly_hopeful&amp;dest=https%3A//maxmrry.github.io/curious-rabbit-hole-bot/&amp;token=9412ce3ed98e5434694fdbb1057a07ce58d5928e92b5cb466c9677cb0e6bd128' style='text-decoration:none;'&gt;🥇✅ Wow, I Feel Positive, Inspired, Impressed&lt;/a&gt; &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;a href='https://redirect-service-73lh.onrender.com/signal?item=qQmfXVE6W-I&amp;signal=2&amp;source=PBS%20Space%20Time&amp;type=youtube&amp;context=pretty_positive&amp;dest=https%3A//maxmrry.github.io/curious-rabbit-hole-bot/&amp;token=9412ce3ed98e5434694fdbb1057a07ce58d5928e92b5cb466c9677cb0e6bd128' style='text-decoration:none;'&gt;💪 Pretty Positive. Kinda Cool.&lt;/a&gt; &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;a href='https://redirect-service-73lh.onrender.com/signal?item=qQmfXVE6W-I&amp;signal=0&amp;source=PBS%20Space%20Time&amp;type=youtube&amp;context=not_interested&amp;dest=https%3A//maxmrry.github.io/curious-rabbit-hole-bot/&amp;token=9412ce3ed98e5434694fdbb1057a07ce58d5928e92b5cb466c9677cb0e6bd128' style='text-decoration:none;'&gt;🥱 Don't Care... Not Interested&lt;/a&gt; &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;a href='https://redirect-service-73lh.onrender.com/signal?item=qQmfXVE6W-I&amp;signal=-1&amp;source=PBS%20Space%20Time&amp;type=youtube&amp;context=too_gloomy&amp;dest=https%3A//maxmrry.github.io/curious-rabbit-hole-bot/&amp;token=9412ce3ed98e5434694fdbb1057a07ce58d5928e92b5cb466c9677cb0e6bd128' style='text-decoration:none;'&gt;⛔ Too Gloomy / Negative&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">brain:qQmfXVE6W-I</guid><enclosure url="https://i.ytimg.com/vi/qQmfXVE6W-I/hqdefault.jpg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/><pubDate>Tue, 19 May 2026 09:36:33 +0100</pubDate></item><item><title>(Research) Business differentiation as a moral obligation</title><link>https://www.notboring.co/p/riding-the-leopard</link><description>&lt;b&gt;Source:&lt;/b&gt; Not Boring by Packy McCormick&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src='https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dght!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F16c24971-a427-4a52-8fe4-046553c0a37a_1200x794.png' alt='thumbnail' style='max-width:100%; border-radius:8px;'/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This article explores the concept of differentiation within the context of business and personal growth. It argues that meaningful distinction, rather than mere competition, constitutes a moral obligation, encouraging readers to embrace unique contributions. This perspective promotes strategic thinking.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;small&gt;&lt;b&gt;How did this land?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href='https://redirect-service-73lh.onrender.com/signal?item=https%3A//www.notboring.co/p/riding-the-leopard&amp;signal=3&amp;source=Not%20Boring%20by%20Packy%20McCormick&amp;type=rss&amp;context=amazingly_hopeful&amp;dest=https%3A//maxmrry.github.io/curious-rabbit-hole-bot/&amp;token=9412ce3ed98e5434694fdbb1057a07ce58d5928e92b5cb466c9677cb0e6bd128' style='text-decoration:none;'&gt;🥇✅ Wow, I Feel Positive, Inspired, Impressed&lt;/a&gt; &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;a href='https://redirect-service-73lh.onrender.com/signal?item=https%3A//www.notboring.co/p/riding-the-leopard&amp;signal=2&amp;source=Not%20Boring%20by%20Packy%20McCormick&amp;type=rss&amp;context=pretty_positive&amp;dest=https%3A//maxmrry.github.io/curious-rabbit-hole-bot/&amp;token=9412ce3ed98e5434694fdbb1057a07ce58d5928e92b5cb466c9677cb0e6bd128' style='text-decoration:none;'&gt;💪 Pretty Positive. Kinda Cool.&lt;/a&gt; &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;a href='https://redirect-service-73lh.onrender.com/signal?item=https%3A//www.notboring.co/p/riding-the-leopard&amp;signal=0&amp;source=Not%20Boring%20by%20Packy%20McCormick&amp;type=rss&amp;context=not_interested&amp;dest=https%3A//maxmrry.github.io/curious-rabbit-hole-bot/&amp;token=9412ce3ed98e5434694fdbb1057a07ce58d5928e92b5cb466c9677cb0e6bd128' style='text-decoration:none;'&gt;🥱 Don't Care... Not Interested&lt;/a&gt; &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;a href='https://redirect-service-73lh.onrender.com/signal?item=https%3A//www.notboring.co/p/riding-the-leopard&amp;signal=-1&amp;source=Not%20Boring%20by%20Packy%20McCormick&amp;type=rss&amp;context=too_gloomy&amp;dest=https%3A//maxmrry.github.io/curious-rabbit-hole-bot/&amp;token=9412ce3ed98e5434694fdbb1057a07ce58d5928e92b5cb466c9677cb0e6bd128' style='text-decoration:none;'&gt;⛔ Too Gloomy / Negative&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">brain:https://www.notboring.co/p/riding-the-leopard</guid><enclosure url="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!dght!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F16c24971-a427-4a52-8fe4-046553c0a37a_1200x794.png" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/><pubDate>Tue, 19 May 2026 09:36:34 +0100</pubDate></item><item><title>(Research) Exercises for sensory reconnection and awareness</title><link>https://psyche.co/guides/how-to-come-back-to-your-senses</link><description>&lt;b&gt;Source:&lt;/b&gt; Psyche | Know Your Self&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This guide presents practical exercises and simple "adventures" designed to help individuals reconnect with the physical world's sensory richness. It addresses the dulling effects of excessive screen time, offering methods to enhance awareness and engagement with one's surroundings.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;small&gt;&lt;b&gt;How did this land?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href='https://redirect-service-73lh.onrender.com/signal?item=https%3A//psyche.co/guides/how-to-come-back-to-your-senses&amp;signal=3&amp;source=Psyche%20%7C%20Know%20Your%20Self&amp;type=rss&amp;context=amazingly_hopeful&amp;dest=https%3A//maxmrry.github.io/curious-rabbit-hole-bot/&amp;token=9412ce3ed98e5434694fdbb1057a07ce58d5928e92b5cb466c9677cb0e6bd128' style='text-decoration:none;'&gt;🥇✅ Wow, I Feel Positive, Inspired, Impressed&lt;/a&gt; &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;a href='https://redirect-service-73lh.onrender.com/signal?item=https%3A//psyche.co/guides/how-to-come-back-to-your-senses&amp;signal=2&amp;source=Psyche%20%7C%20Know%20Your%20Self&amp;type=rss&amp;context=pretty_positive&amp;dest=https%3A//maxmrry.github.io/curious-rabbit-hole-bot/&amp;token=9412ce3ed98e5434694fdbb1057a07ce58d5928e92b5cb466c9677cb0e6bd128' style='text-decoration:none;'&gt;💪 Pretty Positive. Kinda Cool.&lt;/a&gt; &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;a href='https://redirect-service-73lh.onrender.com/si