0e6bd128' style='text-decoration:none;'&gt;⛔ Too Gloomy / Negative&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">brain:1pB2HI6IF1E</guid><enclosure url="https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1pB2HI6IF1E/hqdefault.jpg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/><pubDate>Tue, 19 May 2026 09:36:37 +0100</pubDate></item><item><title>(Video) Apple's CEO succession: The unknown engineer scenario</title><link>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QfUb5MEAOXA</link><description>&lt;b&gt;Source:&lt;/b&gt; ColdFusion&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src='https://i.ytimg.com/vi/QfUb5MEAOXA/hqdefault.jpg' alt='thumbnail' style='max-width:100%; border-radius:8px;'/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This video explores a hypothetical scenario regarding Apple's future leadership, discussing the possibility of an "unknown engineer" succeeding Tim Cook as CEO. It speculates on the implications and dynamics of such an appointment for the company's direction. The discussion analyzes Apple's CEO transition.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;small&gt;&lt;b&gt;How did this land?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href='https://redirect-service-73lh.onrender.com/signal?item=QfUb5MEAOXA&amp;signal=3&amp;source=ColdFusion&amp;type=youtube&amp;context=amazingly_hopeful&amp;dest=https%3A//maxmrry.github.io/curious-rabbit-hole-bot/&amp;token=9412ce3ed98e5434694fdbb1057a07ce58d5928e92b5cb466c9677cb0e6bd128' style='text-decoration:none;'&gt;🥇✅ Wow, I Feel Positive, Inspired, Impressed&lt;/a&gt; &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;a href='https://redirect-service-73lh.onrender.com/signal?item=QfUb5MEAOXA&amp;signal=2&amp;source=ColdFusion&amp;type=youtube&amp;context=pretty_positive&amp;dest=https%3A//maxmrry.github.io/curious-rabbit-hole-bot/&amp;token=9412ce3ed98e5434694fdbb1057a07ce58d5928e92b5cb466c9677cb0e6bd128' style='text-decoration:none;'&gt;💪 Pretty Positive. Kinda Cool.&lt;/a&gt; &amp;nbsp;|&amp;nbsp; &lt;a href='https://redirect-service-73lh.onrender.com/signal?item=QfUb5MEAOXA&amp;signal=0&amp;source=ColdFusion&amp;type=youtube&amp;conte